    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no canvas. i keep trying to look for things, but it's like when you look for a color in a room that has no light. nothing sticks. i try to pick up a book or watch a show and i just stare at it. it's like i'm just occupying space. i'm just a shell that's waiting for something to happen, but i know nothing is going to happen. i'm just... gone.",
