    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think a cup of tea is going to fix the fact that i don't even want to be here. it's not even like i'm sad, i'm just... finished. it feels like i've reached the end of the book and i'm just staring at the blank pages at the back. why bother trying to fill a space that feels so hollow? it's exhausting to keep pretending there's something left to save.",
